       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PREFIX-RANGE-SUM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-VALUES.
          05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 3.
          05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 1.
          05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 4.
          05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 1.
          05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 5.
          05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 9.
          05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 2.
          05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 6.
       01 WS-VALS REDEFINES WS-VALUES.
          05 WS-V PIC 99 OCCURS 8 TIMES.
       01 WS-PREFIX.
          05 WS-P PIC 999 OCCURS 9 TIMES VALUE 0.
       01 WS-I PIC 9.
       01 WS-ANSWER PIC 999.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 8
               COMPUTE WS-P(WS-I + 1) = WS-P(WS-I) + WS-V(WS-I)
           END-PERFORM
           COMPUTE WS-ANSWER = WS-P(6) - WS-P(3)
           DISPLAY WS-ANSWER
           STOP RUN.
